{
  "bookId": "activity-extra-2ndspecial",
  "id": "source-33301",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "33301001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥菲利亚",
          "text": "醒醒，葵，快醒醒。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33301002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "......唔？好......吵。\n今天的太阳格外温暖呢。想再睡一会儿......",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33301003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柔嘉",
          "text": "抱歉！打扰您休息了。但是，有必须向您确认的事......",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33301004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥菲利亚",
          "text": "葵，你在花盆里种的这个......是什么?",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33301005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "......哎？已经，长出来了吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33301006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "白菜狗",
          "text": "汪！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33301007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柔嘉",
          "text": "......菜？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33301008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥菲利亚",
          "text": "......狗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33301009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "唔？白菜变成狗了，好奇怪的梦呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33301010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "白菜狗",
          "text": "汪汪。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33301011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柔嘉",
          "text": "它、它从花盘里钻出来了......怎么办？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33301012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "没关系，它没有恶意。\n别、别舔......痒痒的......",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33301013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥菲利亚",
          "text": "好奇怪......\n既然这是葵亲手种的，那么，种子是从哪里来的呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33301014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "是主人给我的，喏，这里还有很多。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33301015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥菲利亚",
          "text": "让我看看——苹果、辣椒、火龙果的种子，还有白蘑的菌丝。看起来明明很普通啊，为什么会种出来——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33301016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "白菜狗",
          "text": "汪！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33301017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柔嘉",
          "text": "不过，|101|给的种子，种出来的一定是善良温柔的生物......在主人回来之前，我们好好照顾它吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33301018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "白菜狗",
          "text": "呜呜......汪！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33301019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柔嘉",
          "text": "呀！它......用鼻子顶我，是我做错了什么吗？\n抱、抱歉！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33301020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥菲利亚",
          "text": "它在撒娇，大概是想和你一起玩。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33301021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柔嘉",
          "text": "那我应该......用鼻子顶回去吗？\n或者，有什么更适合它的游戏......",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33301022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥菲利亚",
          "text": "对了！主人亲手为我们做过一个精致、小巧的风筝，还记得吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33301023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "唔......这里没有阻挡光线的东西，很适合晒太阳呢。\n晚安，梦里见——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33301024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柔嘉",
          "text": "要、要怎么做呢？我没有放过风筝。\n仅仅扯出风筝线的话，它是飞不起来的吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33301025",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "白菜狗咬住地上的风筝线，逆风奔跑，|101|亲手绘制的风筝摇摇晃晃地浮到空中。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33301026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥菲利亚",
          "text": "快点，我们也跟着跑起来吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33301027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柔嘉",
          "text": "是！啊不，好的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33301028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥菲利亚",
          "text": "剩下的问题，等主人回来再慢慢问清楚......\n现在，就先好好享受放风筝的悠闲时光！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33301029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "白菜狗",
          "text": "汪汪，汪！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
